          "label": "PBPS2609.06905v1 Appendix B3: B20 corrector definition, Lemma B.3 sharp B23 estimate and B21 rotation. Same spectral square root, actual centered restriction and inverse commutation; ASTIS positive-square commutation background adapter.",
          "scope": "Same-root and actual centered inverse commutation plus B23 coefficient square identity only. Sharp B23 norm estimate/B21 rotation/full energy/H1/dynamics/errors/cost/composition not yet proved. All original finite Hilbert/Borel/C2/both Hessians/positive capped eta callers preserved. D=I+T positivity and all commutations are internally proved, never extra public paper premises."
